{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>וישכון</b> — In the Masorah: this one, and the others: וישכון הענן במדבר פארן, וישכון ישראל בטח בדד, וישכון בירושלם וגו', וישכון ערים נכחדות — to teach that the glory of YHWH that dwelt upon Mount Sinai was with them forever, as long as they did not become wicked in their deeds. But once they became wicked — וישכון ערים נכחדות — and the House was destroyed and the Shekhinah withdrew, destined to return to us swiftly in our days."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:16.827691825Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}